    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Metal Coffin is a mix of strategy and card battler. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the tools provided make your way thought the map and complete the campaign. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make on the over-world will dictate your options during the card fights. Select your ships equipment wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/f714982755fa2cdf13b28a819b279f28.poster.avif?t=1751133598\" width=608 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/f714982755fa2cdf13b28a819b279f28.webm?t=1751133598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/f714982755fa2cdf13b28a819b279f28.mp4?t=1751133598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every big campaign is primarily financial, managing your expenses is crucial to making it through. From keeping your fleet's fuel supplies topped up to repairing any damages made in combat, unexpected costs will always arise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/9929f8a2aba31aaa0db47dbe8cfc96fb.poster.avif?t=1751133598\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/9929f8a2aba31aaa0db47dbe8cfc96fb.webm?t=1751133598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/9929f8a2aba31aaa0db47dbe8cfc96fb.mp4?t=1751133598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized map creation at the start of new run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ship parts that can be combined to create a wide variety of deck combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple events that can take place in each port fleets land on</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Metal Coffin is a mix of strategy and card battler. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the tools provided make your way thought the map and complete the campaign. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make on the over-world will dictate your options during the card fights. Select your ships equipment wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/f714982755fa2cdf13b28a819b279f28.poster.avif?t=1751133598\" width=608 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/f714982755fa2cdf13b28a819b279f28.webm?t=1751133598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/f714982755fa2cdf13b28a819b279f28.mp4?t=1751133598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every big campaign is primarily financial, managing your expenses is crucial to making it through. From keeping your fleet's fuel supplies topped up to repairing any damages made in combat, unexpected costs will always arise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/9929f8a2aba31aaa0db47dbe8cfc96fb.poster.avif?t=1751133598\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/9929f8a2aba31aaa0db47dbe8cfc96fb.webm?t=1751133598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551150/extras/9929f8a2aba31aaa0db47dbe8cfc96fb.mp4?t=1751133598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\